# Terraform working directories
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state files
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Terraform crash logs
**/crash.log

# Terraform lock files
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Terraform variable files
# These can contain sensitive values
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Terraform plan files
**/*.tfplan


